"P431306392" "We've got a problem. Wyvern mercenaries have broken into one of the Arachnos bases and fled to Nerva Isle with some encrypted files. It's only a matter of time before Wyvern cracks the encryption on the files. The problem is that they've also sabotaged our troop transport! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head to the Wyvern hideout and recover the files before it's too late.</A><br><br>You have 75 minutes to complete this mission."
