// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2566271789" "The Cage Consortium has been having problems with the Freakshow disrupting operations. Kirk Cage, as head of the Cage Consortium and Governor of Sharkhead Isle, has passed his complaints on to Marshal Gerald who, in typical trickle-down fashion, has passed this problem on to me to handle. So, I'm authorized to place a bounty on the Freakshow. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I hereby deputize you as an Arachnos representative to cull the Freakshow on Sharkhead Isle.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3667851524" "Cull Freakshow"
// SendOffString :
"P1605784924" "We can't let this riff-raff run roughshod, right?"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2211141449" "You haven't filled your quota on Freakshow yet. Please get on that ASAP."

